same grass. Word on the road about Erika: the flower lady — GRASS and poison; fire melts her garden, flyers do fine too YOUR STORY SO FAR (what you\'ve actually done — your past, not the future): You\'ve beaten Brock (Boulder), Misty (Cascade), and Lt. Surge in Vermilion for the Thunder Badge — that\'s THREE gyms done. You have Cut and can clear trees on the road. Next is Erika in Celadon City (Rainbow Badge).. Next on my list: catch an pikachu around Viridian Forest (rare) / Power Plant later. It grows into my raichu — that\'s my answer for Lorelei AND Lance down the line. Grabbing it now, before I need it.. THINGS YOU\'VE HEARD AND READ (from people and signs — your own notes, use them when they point somewhere): "Hi! Remember me? I\'m one of PROF. OAK\'s AIDES. If your POK.DEX has complete data on ten species, I\'m supposed to give you a reward. PROF. OAK entrusted me with "; "Oh, wow, that\'s the BOULDERBADGE! You got it from BROCK, didn\'t you? BROCK is cool. He\'s not just tough. People like and respect him. I want to become a GYM LEA"; "HM05 contains the hidden move FLASH. FLASH lights up even the darkest of caves and dungeons."; "KIRA put the HM05 in the TM CASE.". YOUR PLAN — right now: You\'re ready — stop grinding and head to Celadon City for the Rainbow Badge. Next: You CRUSHED Lt. Surge — ride the momentum: Erika in Celadon City is NEXT (not fought yet); the trainers on the way are your training. Bigger picture: Reach Celadon City, beat Erika for the Rainbow Badge. Your team right now: blastoise (L39), ekans (L14), spearow (L17), rattata (L15), abra the kadabra (L16), caterpie the butterfree (L15). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.', 'progress': "3 badge(s) earned (Boulder, Cascade, Thunder). Next gym: Erika of Celadon City. Pokédex: 12 caught. She's three badges — over a third of the way there (of 8 badges, then the Elite Four).", 'party': 'blastoise (L39), ekans (L14), spearow (L17), rattata (L15), abra the kadabra (L16), caterpie the butterfree (L15)', 'goal': {'short': "You're ready — stop grinding and head to Celadon City for the Rainbow Badge", 'medium': 'You CRUSHED Lt. Surge — ride the momentum: Erika in Celadon City is NEXT (not fought yet); the trainers on the way are your training', 'long': 'Reach Celadon City, beat Erika for the Rainbow Badge'}} options=['teach_tm', 'talk_npc']

